Phytoremediation Process of Water Spinach (Ipomoea aquatica) in Absorbing Heavy Metal
Concentration in Wastewater
Nurul Izzah Badrul Hisama, Mohd Zuhairi Zakariaa,b, Azman Azida,*, Mohd Fahmi Abu Bakara, Mohd Saiful
